#: packages/claudia-computes/src/claudia_computes/functions
msgid "the position (from 1) of the value. Match mode 0 is exact, -1 the exact value or else the next smaller, 1 or else the next larger, 2 exact with wildcards. Search mode 1 looks from the first, -1 from the last. Not found is #N/A."
